<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Deliverability</h2>
<p>For deliverability, audit consent capture and purchase-event suppression before the first flow goes live — every app must record deliverability opt-ins you can evidence and halt promos at checkout. Protect the deliverability channel first: post-purchase, refund-window, and support-case promos do more damage than dull deliverability copy.</p>
