<thead><tr><th>Audience state</th><th>Required handling</th><th>Why it matters</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>No documented consent</td><td>No deliverability promos without proof; transactional messages only</td><td>Without deliverability consent proof, marketing has no legal footing</td></tr>
<tr><td>Consented, never purchased</td><td>First deliverability touches teach and reassure before selling</td><td>Premature deliverability offers teach shoppers to wait</td></tr>
<tr><td>Active cart, no checkout</td><td>Remind deliverability carts with context first, no instant code</td><td>Guards deliverability margin while intent peaks</td></tr>
<tr><td>Purchased recently</td><td>Pause deliverability promos; switch to post-purchase teaching</td><td>Deliverability suppression protects the new-customer glow</td></tr>
<tr><td>Refund or return open</td><td>Deliverability selling waits for case resolution</td><td>Deliverability messaging lands badly during open cases</td></tr>
<tr><td>Repeated non-engagement</td><td>Remove chronic deliverability non-openers pre-complaint</td><td>Keeps deliverability placement high via list hygiene</td></tr>
<tr><td>SMS consent present</td><td>Deliverability texting respects time and frequency rules</td><td>One deliverability SMS complaint outweighs many email ones</td></tr>
<tr><td>Wholesale or B2B account</td><td>Send deliverability B2B accounts down their own track</td><td>B2B deliverability mis-sends risk contract breach</td></tr>
<tr><td>Free or disposable email domain</td><td>Screen deliverability free/disposable emails before flows</td><td>Deliverability bounces from junk signups hurt inboxing</td></tr>
<tr><td>Staff and test accounts</td><td>Deliverability internal accounts never enter production</td><td>Deliverability reporting stays clean without test noise</td></tr>
<tr><td>Competitor or researcher signals</td><td>Treat deliverability snoops under normal consent policy</td><td>Deliverability one-offs breed audit gaps</td></tr>
<tr><td>Legacy list without timestamps</td><td>Reconfirm deliverability consent where timestamps are missing</td><td>Deliverability lists without proof invite liability</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
